# The shop's certificate authority and the machines that rely on it.
#
#   root       no cable     where the root CA will live: files reach it by hand
#   ca         10.0.9.5     where the partners' issuing CA will live; nginx serves what it publishes
#   web        10.0.9.1     nginx: api.shop.test, the partners' API
#   depot      10.0.9.3     the warehouse's server, a partner
#   courier    10.0.9.4     the courier's server, a partner
#   office     10.0.9.2     a staff laptop
#   resolver   10.0.9.53    the shop's name server (Unbound)
#
# root is on no network at all: it has no link and no lan line.
machine root
machine ca
machine web
machine depot
machine courier
machine office
machine resolver

lan shopnet ca:eth0=10.0.9.5/24 web:eth0=10.0.9.1/24 depot:eth0=10.0.9.3/24 courier:eth0=10.0.9.4/24 office:eth0=10.0.9.2/24 resolver:eth0=10.0.9.53/24

dns ca 10.0.9.53
dns web 10.0.9.53
dns depot 10.0.9.53
dns courier 10.0.9.53
dns office 10.0.9.53

run resolver unbound
run web nginx
run ca nginx
